    <description>High route-quality, low-attach-rate techs surface here. WO completion volume MTD grouped by Owner (tech). Read alongside Attach Rate by Tech (MTD): high WO count + low lead count = coaching candidate. Threshold guidance: techs at &lt;5% attach rate are flagged in dashboard text.</description>
    <filter>
